{
  "module": "sessions/volume",
  "fn": "sessionVolumeKg",
  "note": "A genuine L/R pair is ONE set at min(weight) × min(reps); a lone side, a pairId without a side, or a 3+ bucket scores each row as logged. Ghosts contribute nothing. Warm-ups are OUT since Precision Lane C (founder decision Q13, the Hevy basis) — the one warm-up case was hand-changed from 400 to 0 on 2026-09-25. Rounded to 2 dp.",
